cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "AVAIL-AI: availability-aware multimodal learning for incomplete clinical cohorts"
abstract: >-
  AVAIL-AI is an availability-aware machine-learning framework for multimodal
  clinical cohorts with missing modalities. It keeps every subject in the model,
  treats availability itself as data, and ships with a leak-free validation
  protocol (leave-one-out, permutation, conformal), a strategy benchmark against
  16 missing-data approaches, a web platform, and bring-your-own-compute tooling
  so raw data never leaves the user's infrastructure.
authors:
